     Updating v5.00 to v5.20 CNet Amiga Pager by Dotoran of Frontiers!
============================================================================

    If you're currently using my version 5.00 Pager, then you'll need to
run the included "PagerUpdate" file. This file will convert the CTRL-A's
used in your "PagerConfigF" file into |'s. Run the file using a RUNA type
command, or else temporarily add it as a pfile/door object, then run as an
ARexx Executable file.

    If already using v5.10 - v5.13, then you do NOT need to use the Update
program. The 5.20 version of Pager should also work on BOTH CNet Amiga, 
v3.05c, as well as the latest 4.26e+ version.

    Replace all command files with the newer ones included in this archive,
however do NOT replace YOUR copy of "PagerConfigF", "Availabilities", or
any of the "Out.???" files, else you'll need to recreate them from scratch!

